## Scope

This MIT license covers the **software** in this repository: everything under
`packages/`, including every `.ts`, `.js`, `.mjs`, `.glsl` and other source
file, plus the build tooling.

It does **not** cover the dataset. Everything under `data/`, along with the
`*.canon.json` measurement files and resolver tables wherever they sit, is
dedicated to the public domain under **CC0 1.0 Universal** — see `LICENSE-DATA`.

The machine-readable statement of that split is `REUSE.toml` (REUSE
specification 3.3). Where this section and `REUSE.toml` appear to disagree,
`REUSE.toml` is the one a license scanner reads; fix the disagreement rather
than picking a winner.

Neither license grants any right in third-party trademarks. See `NOTICE`.
